      "textSHA256": "8fe2be88829a4d884a70f29325c813793e6a39222e4ec621134db558d6f95a8a",
      "startUnicode": 142,
      "endUnicode": 153,
      "quote": "元神与忌神同动，四也。",
      "quoteSHA256": "71f7e76f0cd52af53c91674cb19735f5e8603efaa065e3543bccae7f4dfa53ca"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "74c82f8be5c04265049119a9383c6bfd1556ad117c9818fc8828feae684873cb",
      "textSHA256": "8fe2be88829a4d884a70f29325c813793e6a39222e4ec621134db558d6f95a8a",
      "startUnicode": 813,
      "endUnicode": 824,
      "quote": "忌神与元神同动，七也。",
      "quoteSHA256": "f185e3ff67249147a47c234c02e631bd44f815b0f5c0cfcf1d4b19a6b2e1b374"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "74c82f8be5c04265049119a9383c6bfd1556ad117c9818fc8828feae684873cb",
      "textSHA256": "8fe2be88829a4d884a70f29325c813793e6a39222e4ec621134db558d6f95a8a",
      "startUnicode": 847,
      "endUnicode": 894,
      "quote": "上论元神、忌神之有力、无力者，亦要用神有气。倘若用神无根，谓之元神有力亦难生，忌神无力亦休喜。",
      "quoteSHA256": "d5b54518de702ea8d3e01918fc8972315af1cceb20d6ef036fcd98127b76d914"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "74c82f8be5c04265049119a9383c6bfd1556ad117c9818fc8828feae684873cb",
      "textSHA256": "8fe2be88829a4d884a70f29325c813793e6a39222e4ec621134db558d6f95a8a",
      "startUnicode": 1002,
      "endUnicode": 1020,
      "quote": "值月破而被克，虽有生扶，奈何生之不起",
      "quoteSHA256": "88dbb14f2e881fa6f722f90156777824a84e05492d3f1585c31f4b36ff3166a7"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-18.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-18.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "4f74faf658faf94f8cd8bda42691a86a77e0aca4b48bcd86af738d6a16349018",
      "textSHA256": "7245c95e0a59be0e811b556991f76cc3ad61c2e5124411b06b1edfa9ce496df4",
      "startUnicode": 1331,
      "endUnicode": 1373,
      "quote": "此言用神临月建，并无他爻以伤克者，凡占皆吉。忌神临月建，而用神休囚无救者，诸占大凶。",
      "quoteSHA256": "5dda93d35ff4567a0b7caba352f0bfb7af031698fe3a83d5d27d0fd496a72eaf"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-18.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-18.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "4f74faf658faf94f8cd8bda42691a86a77e0aca4b48bcd86af738d6a16349018",
      "textSHA256": "7245c95e0a59be0e811b556991f76cc3ad61c2e5124411b06b1edfa9ce496df4",
      "startUnicode": 1840,
      "endUnicode": 1864,
      "quote": "月克日生，遇帮扶而愈旺，月生日克，逢克制而亦衰。",
      "quoteSHA256": "0d5865fc80dd8251b79984074f1e85f8c7a2c0fb72daa166100bb33e7d98a860"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-18.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-18.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "4f74faf658faf94f8cd8bda42691a86a77e0aca4b48bcd86af738d6a16349018",
      "textSHA256": "7245c95e0a59be0e811b556991f76cc3ad61c2e5124411b06b1edfa9ce496df4",
      "startUnicode": 424,
      "endUnicode": 434,
      "quote": "在旬内者，毕竟为空。",
      "quoteSHA256": "24ba7069a8608158603268b69c7883f5552eb5c55e1cd3fb40d49752b7a36b09"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-40.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-40.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "e74764848deb4fd0ffe5e3bd16d696701dd5b06de034a085d74f24a35f0f2c2f",
      "textSHA256": "55a6fd7e4c371c02c11b17357e35a4e407784c32142f814a40a1b719cfb3cba8",
      "startUnicode": 325,
      "endUnicode": 348,
      "quote": "应临月建之财以克世，许之必得。彼问：何日到手？",
      "quoteSHA256": "d31307a2962475afb7625a514f0de32af0ac5ec76d85450826159d909f4f4117"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-40.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-40.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "e74764848deb4fd0ffe5e3bd16d696701dd5b06de034a085d74f24a35f0f2c2f",
      "textSHA256": "55a6fd7e4c371c02c11b17357e35a4e407784c32142f814a40a1b719cfb3cba8",
      "startUnicode": 1300,
      "endUnicode": 1313,
      "quote": "许巳年者，因合前卦而断也。",
      "quoteSHA256": "b9a0a3b5e4fb405212dfe3f960548a39ea985e62eec73792b7c45a391e0b607d"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "74c82f8be5c04265049119a9383c6bfd1556ad117c9818fc8828feae684873cb",
      "textSHA256": "8fe2be88829a4d884a70f29325c813793e6a39222e4ec621134db558d6f95a8a",
      "startUnicode": 955,
      "endUnicode": 1020,
      "quote": "幸得元神酉金亦动，忌神未土反生元神之酉金，金生亥水，接续相生，化凶而为吉矣。岂知亥水月冲日克，值月破而被克，虽有生扶，奈何生之不起",
      "quoteSHA256": "c14f17cd416f14a5e261cebb93a38361c0c929d9ac7c191d4db63ed83f8a267f"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "74c82f8be5c04265049119a9383c6bfd1556ad117c9818fc8828feae684873cb",
      "textSHA256": "8fe2be88829a4d884a70f29325c813793e6a39222e4ec621134db558d6f95a8a",
      "startUnicode": 84,
      "endUnicode": 107,
      "quote": "元神旺相，或临日月，或得日月动爻生扶者，一也。",
      "quoteSHA256": "405892c724cf6fc6ba956dbd44a2f6f8e988b513059df39e598ed94e89486658"
    },
    {
      "sourceFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.txt",
      "htmlFile": "../efficacy-2026-09-21/quanxue-11.html",
      "htmlSHA256": "74c82f8be5c04265049119a9383c6bfd1556ad117c9818fc8828feae684873cb",
      "textSHA256": "8fe2be88829a4d884a70f29325c813793e6a39222e4ec621134db558d6f95a8a",
      "startUnicode": 54,
      "endUnicode": 73,
      "quote": "元神虽生用神，须要旺相，方能生得用神。",
      "quoteSHA256": "7841b2604925ef427a93c4a00f85b564718a6bb4afb1089bb461005bec216ff9"
    }
  ]
}
